# name: follow
# description: follow anything you name from the COCO list (person, dog, cat, bottle, chair, cup...)
# triggers: follow the, follow that, follow it, come with me, keep near it, trail the, tail the, stay with, keep close to
# plan: locate the target@FOLLOW | trail it at a safe distance@FOLLOW
#
# Generic follow: say "follow the <object>" for any COCO class (synonyms like
# couch/tv/table understood). Trails the closest one at a safe standoff — move
# mode, obstacle-aware, never pushes — and turns to re-find it if it leaves view.
# The target is parsed from your command (pushing stays ball-only; the robot
# can't push arbitrary objects). Runs until Stop.

PRINT "Following — press Stop to end."
SET r = FOLLOW("person", 1.0)
PRINT "Stopped following."
